  The reel_script says the damage occurred 'in three places' and then lists the locations, but the article lists the three locations (Panneerselvam Park, Municipal Colony, near Modakkurichi) without saying exactly what happened at each; the draft's claim that the damage occurred at all three places is consistent, but the phrase 'மூன்று இடங்களில் சேதம் ஏற்பட்டது' is fine—however the reel_script omits that the 'statue' damage and library/party office damage were the same event, which is acceptable; no mismatch found in that regard.
  The reel_script and caption say the library 'கண்ணாடி, கதவு, மணல்மேடு தி.மு.க. அலுவலக கண்ணாடி' were damaged, but the article's phrasing combines 'நூலக கண்ணாடி, கதவு, மணல்மேடு தி.மு.க., அலுவலக கண்ணாடி' ambiguously; the draft attributes 'மணல்மேடு' to the DMK office, which is an interpretation not explicitly stated in the article.
  The reel_script omits the 'hand' being arrested: it says the person who incited (the other person on the phone) should be arrested, which matches, but it does not state the sentence is a demand, and the reel_script says 'கைது செய்ய வேண்டும்' as a demand—consistent with the article.
